UID:o9DoXWfeg57ogkd-gtgtV
SUMMARY:Greater Houston Business Procurement Breakfast
DTSTAMP:20260719T101131Z
DTSTART:20260721T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join the B2G Victory Team and come by their table at the Greate
	r Houston Business Procurement Forum (GHBP). \nBreakfast Served: 8:00AM- 9
	:00AM \nThe GHBP is excited to: \n\nProvide a venue that “Makes Business H
	appen” for Houston’s small and minority business community and the communi
	ty at large.\nConnects key contacts that lead to contracts and financing\n
	Facilitate  management and technical assistance\nAssist in the growth and 
	development of the Houston Community\nGenerates real business Success Stor
	ies\n\nFor more information about the Greater Houston Business Procurement
	 (GHBP) Forum\, visit: https://ghbpf.org/contact/#calendar-fe92efaa-617b-4
	a09-bd7f-7e198bdab716-event-m681n7cz\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/event/grea
	ter-houston-business-procurement-breakfast-10/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/greater-houston-business-procurement-brea
